                    <img src="https://github.com/dilaa62/NEEDMAP/blob/main/ib7.png?raw=true" alt="Kabar 3" class="kabar-img">
                    <div>
                        <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #ddd;">15 September 2026</span> <span class="tag-kategori bg-kuning teks-hijau-tua" style="margin-left: 10px;">Produk</span>
